  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rapid Stabilization Support &amp; Early Recovery Initiative (RSS-ERI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to stability and peace through an integrated stabilization package that provides a contextually appropriate bridge to longer-term development interventions, with an exit strategy defined in conjunction with government and civil society counterparts. The project is designed to leverage early recovery gains into sustainable government-led development trajectories while consolidating stability and scaling up resilience in fragile areas faced with transition from ATMIS to local forces.</narrative>
  </description>
